            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>New Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fresh installs now discover their model list from the AI CLIs you actually have installed, automatically selecting the latest recommended model instead of seeding a fixed list of preset profiles. Settings marks that auto-selected model as the default and explains it in a tooltip.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Truncated pane titles now show the full title on hover, both in editable pane headers and in the shared pane header bar.</li>
<li>The project browser now shows hidden files and folders such as .env and .github, and file search matches them too.</li>
<li>Sidebar project rows now display server activity, not just agent activity, so a running dev server shows up even when no model is working.</li>
<li>Successful Git pulls now confirm with a &quot;Pulled successfully&quot; toast instead of only surfacing failures.</li>
<li>Auto-compaction and the process window curtain now default to off, and code reviews now start collapsed by default.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed the Memory pane reloading and re-laying out repeatedly, including redundant text measurement, so it opens and updates more smoothly.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Internal Changes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Removed an unused SwiftTerm dependency entry from the package lockfile.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
